title: "speech_to_text: a Speech-To-Text toolkit built on the BaseModel interface (Whisper + TensorRT-LLM)"
abstract: >-
  Speech-To-Text (STT) toolkit built on the `BaseModel` interface, providing a
  keras implementation of `Whisper`, transcription / search utilities and
  TensorRT-LLM accelerated inference — part of the yui-mhcp projects.
